§§ LSP METHODS (full-set v3.17-subset)
  § lifecycle
    initialize               ← capabilities-declaration
    initialized              ← post-init hook
    shutdown                 ← cleanup
    exit                     ← terminate
  § document-sync
    textDocument/didOpen
    textDocument/didChange   ← debounced 200ms
    textDocument/didSave
    textDocument/didClose
  § diagnostics
    textDocument/publishDiagnostics  ← server-push
  § features
    textDocument/hover
    textDocument/completion
    textDocument/formatting
    textDocument/rangeFormatting
    textDocument/definition
    textDocument/references
    textDocument/documentSymbol
    textDocument/codeAction
    textDocument/codeLens
    textDocument/semanticTokens/full    ← rich highlighting beyond TextMate
  § workspace
    workspace/didChangeConfiguration
    workspace/symbol
    workspace/didChangeWatchedFiles

§§ INCREMENTAL-SYNC
  didChange → debounce 200ms → full-re-parse (incremental-AST-patching v2-scope)
  cache : per-URI last-parse-result + last-typecheck + last-SMT
  invalidation on-change → bump version • stale-results marked
  background-parse : tokio-spawn per-URI • join-on-publishDiagnostics

§§ SEVERITY-MAPPING
  CSL-E-xxx   → LSP Error
  CSL-W-xxx   → LSP Warning
  CSL-I-xxx   → LSP Information
  permissive-accept → Hint (wavy-underline subtle)
  SMT-counter-example → Error w/ related-info (counter-example location)
  opt-stats  → Information (optional • user-toggle)

§§ HOVER-CONTENT (markdown-rendered)
  glyph : `≤` (ASCII: `<=` or `le`)
    Unicode U+2264 • less-than-or-equal
    Category : comparison-operator
  morpheme 'd : durative
    refinement : {v | duration(v) > 0}
    morpheme-slot : Aspect
    docs-ref : specs/04_MORPHEMES.csl §§ durative
  type : Fn<Int → Int / ⟨⟩>
    inferred-at : line 42 col 10
    effect-row : pure ⟨⟩
    refinements : none
  compound .(of) :
    Sanskrit : tatpuruṣa • Karmadhāraya
    semantics : attributive-composition
    associativity : left

§§ COMPLETION-CONTEXTS
  after `'` : 9 morphemes ('d 'f 's 't 'e 'm 'p 'g 'r) + doc-tooltip each
  after `§` : modal-list (I> W! R! M? N! Q?) + think-blocks (§P §D §T §S §C)
  after `.` : .(of) compound • field-access (if-record-type)
  after `⊗` : ⊗(having) compound
  after `@` : @(at) compound • attribute-list
  after `+` : +(and) compound • arithmetic
  ident-position : scope-symbols + imports + built-ins
  type-position : type-constructors + user-types + refinement-builders
  snippet-support : fn { ... } • def name = ... • enum { ... }

§§ CLI-SURFACE
  lsp-server --stdio                     (default • VSCode-compat)
  lsp-server --tcp=localhost:9257        (debug-mode)
  lsp-server --log-level=debug|info|warn|error
  lsp-server --parser-path=<path>        (override parser.exe location)
  lsp-server --version

§§ WORKSPACE-INDEX
  cache : ~/.cslv3-lsp-cache/<workspace-hash>/index.sqlite
  tables : files(uri, mtime, hash) + symbols(file_id, name, kind, range, type)
  refresh : file-watch + didChangeWatchedFiles
  query : workspace/symbol + definition cross-file

§§ ACCEPTANCE
  ✓ opens .csl file → diagnostics publish ≤ 500ms (first-open)
  ✓ didChange → re-diagnostics ≤ 300ms (debounced + cached)
  ✓ hover on ≤ → full markdown-rendered explanation
  ✓ hover on 'd → morpheme-expansion + refinement + docs-link
  ✓ hover on ident → inferred-type + effect-row + refinements
  ✓ completion after `'` → 9-morphemes with doc-tooltips
  ✓ completion after `§` → modal-list
  ✓ format-document → canonical output • RT-safe
  ✓ format-range → scoped-pprint preserves surroundings
  ✓ goto-definition → cross-file via-workspace-index
  ✓ references → all-use-sites listed
  ✓ documentSymbol → outline-tree per-file
  ✓ code-action : unknown-morpheme → suggest-nearest (Levenshtein-distance)
  ✓ code-action : PERMISSIVE_ACCEPT → "promote-to-strict" quick-fix
  ✓ semanticTokens → 74-glyphs highlighted beyond-TextMate
  ✓ workspace/symbol → fuzzy-search cross-file
  ✓ SMT-diagnostic counter-example rendered inline
  ✓ VSCode extension loads + syntax-highlights
